(7716030, 1268614, 75585, '<td valign="top">I really like this I think if this had been composed with the rock on the right third mark it would have been more appealing for me composition wise. If the sun had been lower in the sky and not quite as bright I think it would have really brought this up a notch or two for me.  Still a gorgeous setting, and kudos to you!</td>', 'I really like this I think if this had been composed with the rock on the right third mark it would have been more appealing for me composition wise. If the sun had been lower in the sky and not quite as bright I think it would have really brought this up a notch or two for me.  Still a gorgeous setting, and kudos to you!', '2022-03-05 12:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7716031, 1268635, 75585, '<td valign="top">I love this - it makes you stop and reflect on it.  For me, I think a bit more breathing room at the top above the stem would have been nice. Still gorgeous though.</td>', 'I love this - it makes you stop and reflect on it.  For me, I think a bit more breathing room at the top above the stem would have been nice. Still gorgeous though.', '2022-03-05 12:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
