(7716036, 1268567, 75585, '<td valign="top">LOOOOVE pier shots - likely because we dont have them where I live.  So, thank you for entering this!  I wish the Horizon didnt dip down on the right BUT I imagine that was because you were working to keep the poles vertically aligned.  I struggle with that ALL the time to keep my horizons level and forefront object unobscured.  I think this location with a low in the sky sun - would add so much as its a bit bright but love how the tones all are working together.</td>', 'LOOOOVE pier shots - likely because we dont have them where I live.  So, thank you for entering this!  I wish the Horizon didnt dip down on the right BUT I imagine that was because you were working to keep the poles vertically aligned.  I struggle with that ALL the time to keep my horizons level and forefront object unobscured.  I think this location with a low in the sky sun - would add so much as its a bit bright but love how the tones all are working together.', '2022-03-05 12:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
